==Old English==

===Etymology===
{{dercat|ang|gem-pro|ine-pro|inh=1}}
From {{inh|ang|gmw-pro|*unnan}}.

Cognate with {{cog|osx|unnan}}, {{cog|goh|unnan}}, {{cog|dum|onnen}} ({{cog|nl|gunnen}}), {{cog|non|unna}} ({{cog|sv|unna}}, {{cog|da|unde}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ang-IPA|unnan}}

===Verb===
{{ang-verb}}

# to [[grant]] or [[bestow]] (+ ''dat'' (person) + ''gen'' (thing))
# to [[wish]]
# to [[intercede]]

====Conjugation====
